<section class="docket-comparison" aria-labelledby="docket-comparison-title">
  <div class="comparison-header">
    <p class="comparison-eyebrow">Interactive interface comparison</p>
    <h3 id="docket-comparison-title">From nested tabs to a scannable dashboard</h3>
    <p>Toggle between the legacy interface and the redesigned architecture to inspect the structural changes.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="ba-widget" data-docket-comparison>
    <div class="ba-controls">
      <div class="ba-toggle-group" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose an interface to preview">
        <button class="ba-btn" id="docket-tab-before" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="docket-panel-before" tabindex="-1" data-view="before">
          Before: Legacy Tabbed UI
        </button>
        <button class="ba-btn ba-btn--active" id="docket-tab-after" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="docket-panel-after" tabindex="0" data-view="after">
          After: Redesigned Dashboard UI
        </button>
      </div>
      <span class="comparison-status" data-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Showing: flattened dashboard + granular editing</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ba-panel" id="docket-panel-before" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="docket-tab-before" data-panel="before" hidden tabindex="0">
      <div class="mock-window">
        <div class="mock-topbar">
          <span>Atlas Legacy · Documento A (ID: 1 · Code: 1234567890)</span>
          <span class="mock-badge mock-badge--warn">4 nested tabs · single global edit</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mock-legacy-tabs">
          <span class="mock-ltab mock-ltab--active">General Info</span>
          <span class="mock-ltab">Issuing Bodies [Hidden]</span>
          <span class="mock-ltab">Required Fields [Hidden]</span>
          <span class="mock-ltab">Sub-docs [Hidden]</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mock-legacy-body">
          <div class="mock-legacy-row">
            <div>
              <p class="mock-field-label">Name Variations</p>
              <p class="mock-field-val">Documento AB, Certidão A, Documento de A</p>
              <p class="mock-field-label mock-field-label--spaced">Issuance Type</p>
              <p class="mock-field-val">Online (Avg. turnaround: 5 business days)</p>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="mock-edit-btn" disabled>Edit Entire Page</button>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-callout mock-callout--warn">
            <strong>UX friction:</strong> 75% of operational rules are invisible on load. Operators must click across four tabs with ambiguous icons and edit the entire record at once, discouraging quick updates.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ba-panel" id="docket-panel-after" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="docket-tab-after" data-panel="after" tabindex="0">
      <div class="mock-window mock-window--active">
        <div class="mock-topbar">
          <span>Atlas Redesigned · <strong>#001 Property Registry Certificate</strong></span>
          <span class="mock-badge mock-badge--ok">0 nested tabs · section-level CRUD</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mock-dashboard-grid">
          <article class="mock-dash-card mock-dash-card--full">
            <div class="mock-card-head">
              <span class="mock-card-title">Document overview &amp; description</span>
              <button type="button" class="mock-edit-pill">✎ Edit section</button>
            </div>
            <p class="mock-card-text">Official real estate registry certificate verifying property ownership, liens, and historical transfers for legal due diligence.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="mock-dash-card">
            <div class="mock-card-head">
              <span class="mock-card-title">Issuing body &amp; rules</span>
              <button type="button" class="mock-edit-pill">✎ Edit section</button>
            </div>
            <ul class="mock-kv-list">
              <li><span>Issuing Body:</span><strong>Real Estate Registry (Cartório)</strong></li>
              <li><span>Scope / PJe:</span><strong>Municipal · PJe Compatible</strong></li>
              <li><span>Delivery:</span><strong>Digital PDF (2–5 days)</strong></li>
            </ul>
          </article>
          <article class="mock-dash-card">
            <div class="mock-card-head">
              <span class="mock-card-title">Required input fields</span>
              <button type="button" class="mock-edit-pill">✎ Edit section</button>
            </div>
            <div class="mock-pills-wrap">
              <span class="mock-data-pill">Full Name (Required)</span>
              <span class="mock-data-pill">CPF / CNPJ (Required)</span>
              <span class="mock-data-pill">Registry Number (Matrícula)</span>
              <span class="mock-data-pill">Online / Offline Flag</span>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="mock-callout mock-callout--ok">
          <strong>Design impact:</strong> High-priority attributes sit one level shallower on a scannable canvas. Independent section editing helps operators keep records accurate without changing unrelated data.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
